-- ============================================================================
-- DR4 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Well Control, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: the kill sheet and the influx description. Six inputs
-- and four outputs, with three of the inputs available only during the event,
-- which is why a sheet can be prepared and never completed in advance. The
-- initial circulating pressure as a static deficit plus a measured friction
-- term, the final one as that friction term scaled by the density ratio, and
-- a straight line in STROKES between them that covers only the string
-- displacement. Influx height from the pit gain over the capacity where the
-- influx actually sits, influx density from the gauge difference over that
-- height, and a classification that comes from the arithmetic rather than
-- from the name on the scenario. Constant bottom hole pressure held by the
-- choke while the pump rate is held steady. Reading the sheet back, where the
-- pit volume is what separates a mechanical deviation from the well.
--
-- WHAT THE SHEET DOES NOT PRODUCE. The casing pressure history. The engine
-- computes the drill pipe schedule and says nothing about what the choke will
-- read at any moment, because that needs a model of the influx position and
-- expansion this engine does not have. The tier says so rather than implying
-- otherwise by omission.
--
-- The oracle module compares the engine against a hand-built IWCF-style
-- example with round inputs, whose kick tolerance comes out to a repeating
-- decimal and can be checked in four lines on paper.
--
-- Answer keys live only here and in academy_quiz_questions, which has no
-- client SELECT policy.
-- ============================================================================

values ('wellcontrol', 'intermediate', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-the-kill-sheet","title":"The Kill Sheet","lesson_keys":["l01-six-inputs-four-outputs","l02-initial-circulating-pressure","l03-final-circulating-pressure","l04-the-schedule-between-them","l05-after-the-bit"]},{"key":"m02-what-the-influx-is","title":"What the Influx Is","lesson_keys":["l01-height-from-pit-gain","l02-density-from-the-difference","l03-gas-liquid-and-mixed","l04-a-scenario-named-gas-that-is-not","l05-what-the-classification-is-for"]},{"key":"m03-holding-bottom-hole-pressure","title":"Holding Bottom Hole Pressure","lesson_keys":["l01-the-constant-bhp-principle","l02-the-choke-is-the-control","l03-pump-rate-changes","l04-what-goes-wrong-on-the-choke"]},{"key":"m04-reading-the-sheet-back","title":"Reading the Sheet Back","lesson_keys":["l01-pressure-above-the-schedule","l02-pressure-below-it","l03-a-second-influx","l04-plugged-and-washed-out","l05-when-to-stop-and-think"]},{"key":"m05-against-the-oracle","title":"Against the Oracle","lesson_keys":["l01-what-the-goldens-are","l02-the-hand-built-example","l03-closed-forms-you-can-check","l04-what-agreement-proves"]},{"key":"m06-the-professional-reading","title":"The Professional Reading","lesson_keys":["l01-the-story-so-far","l02-working-the-capstone","l03-onward"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
on conflict (app_slug, tier) do update
  set structure = excluded.structure,
      content_version = excluded.content_version,
      active = true,
      updated_at = now();

delete from public.academy_quiz_questions
 where app_slug = 'wellcontrol' and tier = 'intermediate';

